{comment: Verse 1}
[F]Joy to the world, the Lord is come
[Bb]The earth receive her King
[Dm]Let every heart prepare Him room
[Bb]And heaven and nature sing
[F/A]And heaven and nature [Bb]sing

{comment: Chorus 1}
We will sing [F]joy [F/A]Oh
[Bb] [Bb/C] [Bb/D] [Bb]

{comment: Verse 2}
Joy to the world the Savior reigns
Let men their songs employ
While fields and floods rock hills and plains
Repeat the sounding joy
Repeat the sounding joy

{comment: Chorus 2}
We will sing [F]joy
We will [F/A]sing [Bb]joy [Bb/C] [Bb/D]__[Bb]
We will [Bb/D]sing [Dm]joy
Joy [Dm/F]to the [Dm]world [Bb]

{comment: Verse 3}
He rules the world with truth and grace
And makes the nations prove
The glories of His righteousness
And wonders of His love
And wonders of His love
Chorus 2 (4x)

